==Turkish==

===Etymology===
{{inh+|tr|ota|شو|tr=şu}}, from {{inh|tr|trk-oat|شول|tr=şol}}, from earlier {{m|trk-oat|اوش اول|tr=uş ol}}. {{surf|tr|uş|ol}}. Cognate with {{cog|kk|сол}} and {{cog|ba|шул}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|tr|/ʃu/}}

===Determiner===
{{head|tr|determiner}}   

# {{lb|tr|[[distal]]}} [[that]], that [[over there]] 
#: {{ux|tr|'''Şu''' kedi diğerlerinden daha zayıf.|'''That''' cat is thinner than the others.}}

===Pronoun===
{{head|tr|pronoun|accusative|şunu|plural|şunlar}}

# {{lb|tr|[[distal]]}} [[that]] (that over there)
#: {{ux|tr|'''Şuna''' bak!|Look '''at that'''!}}
#: {{ux|tr|'''Şunlar''' senin arkadaşların değil mi?|Aren't '''those''' your friends?}}

